# Scratch queue rows PTH (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.1). Data: the queue table in scratch_queue.md is generated
# from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py docstring.
# Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/PTH.qb RES [--section KEY] [--rows ID,...]

@@section 1
@@title SQ-PTH Pass-through blocks, phase 1 core, 2026-11-14 ([plan_passthrough.md](../plan_passthrough.md) 1, 2, 8; TODO `gameplay/blockrunner #10`)
@@date 2026-11-14
@@jars creativecompat creativedevtools
@@sources feature_writeup/plan_passthrough.md
@@text
@@text Creative Compat 1.0.0 built 2026-11-14 (build/libs, not installed). The tier tags come in phase 4: until then a row
@@text needs a scratch datapack in `srv/` with `data/creativecompat/tags/blocks/passthrough/<tier>.json` (and entity tag
@@text `passthrough_exempt/cobweb` = spiders) holding the blocks named. Rows can wait for phase 4 and run with its tags.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-PTH-01 | boot: no pass-through mixin error; [surface.passthrough] keys and 11 tier tables
@group A
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `InsideBlocksMixin`, `MakeStuckInBlockMixin`, `Mixin apply failed`; read `config/creativecompat-common.toml`
@pass no mixin error; `[surface.passthrough]` with `enabled`, `arrowLifeTicks`, `arrowLongLifeCap` and 11 tier tables
@fails mixin SRG names (`m_20101_`, `m_7601_`); `CompatConfig.Surface.Passthrough`
@from batches/r1115/pth_a0.qb
bootreject Mixin apply failed
bootreject InvalidMixin
bootreject (InsideBlocksMixin|MakeStuckInBlockMixin).*(rror|xception|fail)
shell grep -cE '^\s*\[surface\.passthrough\.[a-z_]+\]' config/creativecompat-common.toml; grep -nE '^\s*(enabled|arrowLifeTicks|arrowLongLifeCap)\s*=' config/creativecompat-common.toml | sed -n '1,40p' | grep -A0 -E 'arrow|enabled'; awk '/^\s*\[surface\.passthrough\]/{f=1} f&&/^\s*\[surface\.passthrough\./{exit} f' config/creativecompat-common.toml | grep -E '='
look shell: 11 tier tables; enabled, arrowLifeTicks, arrowLongLifeCap under [surface.passthrough]

## SQ-PTH-02 | cobweb tier: lone web -0.5, cube centre -0.65, keeps moving, barbed wire hurts (razor wire added)
@group A
@commands Datapack: cobweb tier = `minecraft:cobweb`, `createaddition:barbed_wire`. Zombie in a lone web, then in a 3x3x3 web cube; `/attribute @e[type=zombie,limit=1,sort=nearest] minecraft:generic.movement_speed modifier value get a1386f64-4583-4798-9b29-f040c59b8574`
@pass value -0.5 in the lone web, -0.65 in the cube centre; the zombie keeps moving (vanilla stuck cancelled); barbed wire still hurts
@fails `PassThrough.cancelsStuck`, the tag; `PassRule.cell`
@from batches/r1115/pth_a1.qb
> setblock 1000 -60 1070 minecraft:cobweb
> fill 1004 -60 1069 1006 -58 1071 minecraft:cobweb
> setblock 1010 -60 1070 immersiveengineering:razor_wire
> setblock 1014 -60 1070 createaddition:barbed_wire
> summon minecraft:zombie 1000.5 -60 1070.5 {Tags:["z02a","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1005.5 -59 1070.5 {Tags:["z02c","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1010.5 -60 1070.5 {Tags:["z02r","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1014.5 -60 1070.5 {Tags:["z02b","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> setblock 1010 -60 1080 minecraft:cobweb
> setblock 1010 -60 1084 createaddition:barbed_wire
> tp Q 1018.5 -60 1082.5
> summon minecraft:zombie 1004.5 -60 1080.5 {Tags:["z02m","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1004.5 -60 1084.5 {Tags:["z02w","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b}
> zpth watch z02m 200 2
> zpth watch z02w 200 2
sleep 4
> zpth mod z02a
> zpth mod z02c
> zpth mod z02r
> zpth mod z02b
sleep 7
> zpth mod z02b
> zpth mod z02w
waitlog watch done z02w 30
expect \[zpth\] mod z02a .* mod=-0\.500
expect \[zpth\] mod z02c .* mod=-0\.650
expect \[zpth\] mod z02r .* mod=-0\.500
look z02m crosses x 1010..1011 without stopping (horizontal motion about half, not vanilla 0.25x); z02b / z02w hp below 20

