## SQ-PTH-04 | reinforced cobweb: owner bot P walks through unslowed, bot Q at 0.50x
@group A
@commands SecurityCraft reinforced cobweb in the cobweb tag: owner walks through, a second player (or bot) does too
@pass owner unslowed, other player 0.50x
@fails `PassOwner` reflection on `IOwnable#isOwnedBy`
@from batches/r1115/pth_a1.qb
> tp P 1000.5 -60 1098.5
> tp Q 1003.5 -60 1098.5
> pbot hold P securitycraft:reinforced_cobweb 1
> pbot use P 1000 -61 1100 up
sleep 1
> data get block 1000 -60 1100
> execute if block 1000 -60 1100 securitycraft:reinforced_cobweb run say PTH04-placed
> tag P add bP
> tag Q add bQ
> zpth watch bP 160 2
> pbot path P 1000.5 -60 1102.5 0.1
sleep 5
> tp Q 1000.5 -60 1098.5
> zpth watch bQ 160 2
> pbot path Q 1000.5 -60 1102.5 0.1
sleep 5
expect PTH04-placed$
look bP: mod=none in the web cell (z 1100..1101); bQ: mod=-0.500 there; owner field in the block data = P

