## SQ-PTH-12 | lone webs: fishing bobber stops and reels in; pickarang held past its timeout, picked up whole; broken web drops it; thorn chakram the same
@group A
@commands Lone web: cast a fishing bobber into it, reel in; throw a Quark pickarang into it (survival), walk into it; throw another, break the web; Botania thorn chakram the same
