@group A
@commands Boot; grep latest.log (server) for `passthrough_tags.js`, `Pass-through tier overlap`, `Projectile group overlap`; `/dumptags block,entity_type`; `/dumpsurface`; then on the instance root `python3 tools/blockrunner_scan.py --audit kubejs/exported/surface_audit.json` and `python3 tools/projectile_scan.py` against the scratch exports
