## SQ-PTH-21 | entity tag groups: projectiles, spider, fox
@group A
@commands `/summon` with `{NoGravity:1b}` 10 blocks up: snowball, potion, quark:pickarang, firework_rocket, arrow, nock_enough_arrows:explosive_arrow, immersiveengineering:revolver_shot, botania:mana_burst, blocky_siege:projectile_fire_bomb, spider, fox; for each `/execute as @e[type=<id>,limit=1,sort=nearest] if entity @s[type=#creativecompat:passthrough/projectile/<group>]` (and `passthrough_exempt/all`, `passthrough_exempt/cobweb`, `passthrough_exempt/bush`)
@pass snowball break, potion settle, pickarang snag, firework linger, both arrows hang, revolver shot, mana burst and fire bomb exempt and exempt/all; spider in exempt/cobweb; fox in exempt/bush and leaf_pile
@fails entity ids in passthrough_tags.js (projectile_scan pairs by registration code: an unverified id may be wrong)
@from batches/r1115/pth_a1.qb
> summon minecraft:snowball 1000.5 -50 1060.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["e21_snowball"]}
> summon minecraft:potion 1002.5 -50 1060.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["e21_potion"]}
> summon quark:pickarang 1004.5 -50 1060.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["e21_pickarang"]}
> summon minecraft:firework_rocket 1006.5 -50 1060.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["e21_firework"]}
> summon minecraft:arrow 1008.5 -50 1060.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["e21_arrow"]}
> summon nock_enough_arrows:explosive_arrow 1010.5 -50 1060.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["e21_explosive_arrow"]}
