## SQ-PTH-22 | rope tomatoes 3x3 age 0 centre -0.5; budding age 1 none, age 2 -0.25; coffee stem age 0 -0.25; taiga grape bush -0.64
@group A
@commands A zombie standing in each of: a 3x3 block of supplementaries rope tomatoes at age 0, FD budding tomatoes age 1 and age 2, a Farmer's Respite coffee stem age 0, a Vinery taiga grape bush; read the modifier each (`/attribute @e[type=zombie,limit=1,sort=nearest] minecraft:generic.movement_speed modifier value get <uuid>`)
@pass rope tomatoes centre -0.5 (dense, age ignored); budding age 1 none, age 2 -0.25; coffee age 0 -0.25; taiga grape bush -0.64
@fails `passthrough_growth_any` members; `PassThrough.grown` (growth_any check before the age rule)
