## SQ-PTH-23 | spider exempt in reinforced cobweb and barbed wire (wire still hurts); zombie -0.5; fox none in berry bush; poppy bush no modifier, stuck kept
@group A
@commands A spider and a zombie each walk through a lone reinforced cobweb and a barbed wire; a fox in a sweet berry bush; a zombie in a Floral Enchantment poppy bush; read the modifier and `/data get entity ... Motion`
@pass spider no modifier in both (barbed wire still damages it); zombie -0.5; fox none; poppy bush: no pass-through modifier, the zombie still crawls (vanilla stuck slowdown kept)
@fails exempt tags (`passthrough_exempt/cobweb`, `/bush`); floralench bushes must stay out of every tier (grass `except`)
